{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415731","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415731","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041573101:1":{"text":"ねえ、葉っぱで顔を隠しているけど、隙間からずっとこっちを覗いてるの、気付いてるわよ。","source_cn":"我注意到你一直用荷叶遮着脸，在叶子的缝隙里悄悄看我呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAF975A2C1F1EB74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041573102:1":{"text":"何か悩みでもあるのかしら、お嬢さん？話ならいくらでも聞くわよ。","source_cn":"是有什么心事想分享吗，小姑娘？尽管向我倾诉好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x374FC8A7A413793B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041573103:1":{"text":"こ、ごめんなさい……盗み見するつもりじゃ……","source_cn":"啊，对不起……我不是故意要偷看的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15CD5B7CE45C9DF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041573104:1":{"text":"ただ、あなたからとてもいい匂いがして……お日様と、露水のついた葉っぱの匂いが……","source_cn":"只是，您身上有股很好闻的气息，是阳光和露水浸透树叶的味道……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCCBF9F0F945A950","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041573105:1":{"text":"あら、うふふ、それはきっと空境の森で毎日植物の世話をしているからね。","source_cn":"呵呵，也许是我每天都在空境森林照看植物的缘故吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x238FDC90FAC3F62A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041573106:1":{"text":"彼らと長く接していると、こっちまで爽やかな空気をまとっている気分になれるのよ。","source_cn":"与它们相伴久了，呼吸都会变得和它们一样清新。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFE3AD36F014E28A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041573107:1":{"text":"空境の森……とても、素敵な名前ですね。","source_cn":"空境森林……听起来真美。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CA4408FFE885D37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041573108:1":{"text":"ありがとう。あそこにはたくさんの植物たちがいるの。ユグドラシルから来たスズランなんて、本当に素敵なのよ。","source_cn":"那里有许多植物，你一定会喜欢那几株从薄暮丛林移栽的铃兰花。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FC35F9F9FA05DF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041573109:0":{"text":"でも最近、何故か元気がなさそうなのよね。葉っぱも丸まっちゃって……","source_cn":"可最近不知为什么，它们总是无精打采地蜷着叶片。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC047D9FF4FDA92E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041573110:0":{"text":"土の魔力濃度を調整してみたり、栄養魔法をかけたりもしたけど、ちっとも改善しなくて。","source_cn":"我试过调整土壤的魔力浓度，还施过滋养咒语，却始终不见好转。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D0948C4F3766C43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041573111:0":{"text":"ユグドラシルの植物は……水が、大事です……","source_cn":"薄暮丛林的植物……对水很挑剔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43E9C03862246AF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041573112:0":{"text":"浪の満ち引きのような、自然の律動に合わせた雨水……多くても、少なくてもだめです……","source_cn":"需要潮汐节律般的雨水，不能多，也不能少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5B4FDA5E6DD6DF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041573113:0":{"text":"なるほど！水やり魔法も調整したけど、自然のリズムが大事なのね。","source_cn":"你说到了关键！我试过调节灌溉魔法，但差了些自然的韵律。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82739ADC1CE6FA9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041573114:1":{"text":"あなたから、優しさと調和のオーラを感じるわ。もしかしたら、彼らにはそれが必要なのかも。","source_cn":"我能感觉到，你身上有一种温柔而协调的气息，或许正是它们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E431EB398B05990","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041573115:1":{"text":"ねえ、空境の森に来て、手伝ってくれないかしら？","source_cn":"你原意来空境森林帮帮忙吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EC2B847C9F1985E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041573116:1":{"text":"わ、わたしは……湖の畔で草花を育てていますが、レヒラムのような、厳かな場所へ行ったことがありません……","source_cn":"我……其实常在湖边照料小花小草，但从没进过莱希拉姆魔法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4352440BBB618326","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041573117:1":{"text":"少し恥ずかしいですが……空境の森がどんな場所なのか、見てみたいです……","source_cn":"虽然有些难为情……不过我真的很好奇，那里会是什么样子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5676E7B10480EA25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041573118:1":{"text":"何も心配はいらないわよ。森にはテストも査定もないわ。いるのは、あなたを必要としている植物たちだけよ。","source_cn":"别担心，那里没有评分和考试，只有几株需要你的植物朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F872D132AD45AA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041573119:1":{"text":"そうね……夕方ならいちばん静かだし、その時に来てくれれば、蛍たちを連れて迎えに行くわ。","source_cn":"你可以黄昏时来，那时最安静，我会携着萤火虫一起迎接你的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5A9D6734AAA235E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041573120:1":{"text":"スズランの問題が解決してもしなくても、森の中を案内してあげる。","source_cn":"哪怕没能治好它们也没关系，我们可以一起参观空境森林。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0FCA622520615EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1041573121:1":{"text":"そうだ、私が特別にブレンドした花茶をご馳走するわ。光るハチミツを混ぜるのよ。","source_cn":"对了，你一定会喜欢我特调的花草茶，里面加了会发光的蜂蜜哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B0A04C6961CFCD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1041573122:0":{"text":"わ、分かりました……夕方に、お邪魔……できるよう頑張ります……！","source_cn":"好吧……我……我会去试试看的……在黄昏时！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2802E43FBF964C91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:娑丽丝":{"text":"ソリス","source":"娑丽丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伊温":{"text":"イヴォンヌ","source":"伊温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":23,"localized_text_count":22,"speaker_count":2}}